# ==============================================================================
# PCA OF RESIDUE-INTERACTION FINGERPRINTS
# FINAL VERSION — ORDER: BZD → BB → GABA
#
# Final characteristics:
#   - PCA panels always ordered:
#         1. BZD
#         2. BB
#         3. GABA
#   - one single Compound legend below all panels;
#   - legend contains all compounds present in the spreadsheet;
#   - "Compound" title NOT bold;
#   - smaller legend markers;
#   - centroid represented by diamond;
#   - ellipses completely contained inside PCA panels;
#   - axes slightly expanded so ellipses appear slightly smaller;
#   - residue labels shown only in upper-right mini-PCA inset;
#   - PCA axis titles are not bold;
#   - no A/B/C panel labels.
# ==============================================================================


